NetOrbit for Raspberry Pi
=========================

This is a standalone port of NetOrbit for Home Assistant
(https://github.com/the-scott-davis/netorbit), Copyright (c) 2026 the-scott-davis,
released under the MIT License (see LICENSE). The discovery, hub detection, topology,
SNMP and Bonjour code, the map card (netorbit_pi/web/netorbit-card.js) and the network
simulator (netorbit_pi/netgen.py) come from that project, adapted to run without
Home Assistant.

netorbit_pi/web/icons.js contains icons from Material Design Icons
(https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
